{
 "about": "A GENERAL PIP that answers 500 on the right of == and != beside each special state on the left: null in the resource and in subject.serviceAccount, a null body, an absent header, an empty list, an empty selection, an absent key and an index past the end. In round 20, c20-000282 read the PIP on the right of null and failed the decision. Each comparison stands in the OR probe of an ALLOW rule, asked with resource.a 'y', and of a DENY rule, asked with resource.a 'n': a failed decision is false in both, an ended rule false and true, a false comparison true and true, a true one true and false.",
